<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Moovkart Info Section</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
    background:#ffffff;
}

.medical-info{
    width:100%;
    background:#f8f8f8;
    padding:70px 20px;
}

.info-container{
    max-width:1100px;
    margin:auto;
    text-align:center;
}

.info-container h2{
    font-size:40px;
    font-weight:500;
    color:#3f3f3f;
    margin-bottom:18px;
    line-height:1.3;
}

.info-container p{
    font-size:19px;
    color:#555;
    line-height:1.9;
    max-width:980px;
    margin:0 auto 40px;
}

.info-container p strong{
    font-weight:600;
    color:#222;
}

.shop-btn{
    display:inline-block;
    background:#33b26c;
    color:#fff;
    text-decoration:none;
    padding:16px 45px;
    border-radius:3px;
    font-size:18px;
    font-weight:500;
    transition:.3s;
}

.shop-btn:hover{
    background:#28985b;
    transform:translateY(-2px);
}

/* Tablet */

@media(max-width:992px){

.info-container h2{
    font-size:32px;
}

.info-container p{
    font-size:17px;
}

}

/* Mobile */

@media(max-width:768px){

.medical-info{
    padding:50px 18px;
}

.info-container h2{
    font-size:26px;
    line-height:1.4;
}

.info-container p{
    font-size:15px;
    line-height:1.8;
    margin-bottom:30px;
}

.shop-btn{
    width:100%;
    max-width:260px;
    padding:15px;
    font-size:16px;
}

}

/* Small Mobile */

@media(max-width:480px){

.info-container h2{
    font-size:22px;
}

.info-container p{
    font-size:14px;
}

}

</style>

</head>
<body>

<section class="medical-info">

<div class="info-container">

<h2>
Moovkart: Shop All Durable And Medical Equipment Online
</h2>

<p>
Discover trusted home healthcare, <strong>mobility aids</strong>, and medical supplies from leading brands—all in one place.
Shop quality products at competitive prices with secure checkout, fast &amp;
<strong>Free Shipping</strong>, and dedicated customer support.
Empower safer, healthier, and more independent living with Moovkart.
</p>

<a href="#" class="shop-btn">
Start Shopping
</a>

</div>

</section>

</body>
</html>